{"seq":1,"slug":"query-parsing","title":"查询解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/query-understanding/query-parsing","wordCount":1119,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"查询解析\">查询解析</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>查询解析（Query Parsing）是搜索系统将用户输入的自然语言查询转化为结构化检索意图的过程。它是查询理解（Query Understanding）管线的第一步，决定了后续检索的方向和质量。查询解析需要识别查询中的实体、意图、约束条件和语义结构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    RAW[原始查询] --&gt; TOK[分词与归一化]&#10;    TOK --&gt; NER[实体识别]&#10;    NER --&gt; INT[意图分类]&#10;    INT --&gt; SLOT[槽位填充]&#10;    SLOT --&gt; STRUCT[结构化查询]&#10;    subgraph 查询解析管线&#10;        TOK&#10;        NER&#10;        INT&#10;        SLOT&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    RAW[原始查询] --&gt; TOK[分词与归一化]\n    TOK --&gt; NER[实体识别]\n    NER --&gt; INT[意图分类]\n    INT --&gt; SLOT[槽位填充]\n    SLOT --&gt; STRUCT[结构化查询]\n    subgraph 查询解析管线\n        TOK\n        NER\n        INT\n        SLOT\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解析组件</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>典型方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分词归一化</td>\n<td>文本预处理</td>\n<td>原始字符串</td>\n<td>标准化 token 序列</td>\n<td>jieba/BPE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实体识别</td>\n<td>提取关键实体</td>\n<td>token 序列</td>\n<td>实体标注序列</td>\n<td>BERT-CRF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>意图分类</td>\n<td>判断查询类别</td>\n<td>token 序列</td>\n<td>意图标签</td>\n<td>文本分类器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>槽位填充</td>\n<td>提取结构化字段</td>\n<td>token + 实体</td>\n<td>键值对</td>\n<td>序列标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询分类</td>\n<td>粗粒度分流</td>\n<td>全部特征</td>\n<td>查询类型</td>\n<td>规则 + 模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"查询意图识别\">查询意图识别</h2><p>查询意图识别（Query Intent Classification）将用户查询分类为预定义的意图类别，是搜索系统路由和策略选择的基础。典型的意图分类体系包括导航型（Navigational）、信息型（Informational）和交易型（Transactional）三大类。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type QueryIntent = &#39;navigational&#39; | &#39;informational&#39; | &#39;transactional&#39; | &#39;local&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface IntentClassifier {&#10;  predict(query: string): Promise&lt;IntentPrediction&gt;;&#10;  predictBatch(queries: string[]): Promise&lt;IntentPrediction[]&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface IntentPrediction {&#10;  intent: QueryIntent;&#10;  confidence: number;&#10;  subIntents: Array&lt;{ label: string; score: number }&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface IntentFeatures {&#10;  queryLength: number;&#10;  hasQuestionWord: boolean;&#10;  containsUrl: boolean;&#10;  containsBrandName: boolean;&#10;  containsActionVerb: boolean;&#10;  avgWordIdf: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function extractIntentFeatures(query: string, vocabulary: Map&lt;string, number&gt;): IntentFeatures {&#10;  const tokens = tokenize(query);&#10;  const questionWords = [&#39;什么&#39;, &#39;怎么&#39;, &#39;如何&#39;, &#39;为什么&#39;, &#39;哪里&#39;, &#39;哪个&#39;];&#10;  const actionVerbs = [&#39;购买&#39;, &#39;下载&#39;, &#39;注册&#39;, &#39;预约&#39;, &#39;比较&#39;];&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    queryLength: tokens.length,&#10;    hasQuestionWord: tokens.some((t) =&gt; questionWords.includes(t)),&#10;    containsUrl: /https?:\\/\\/|www\\./.test(query),&#10;    containsBrandName: false,&#10;    containsActionVerb: tokens.some((t) =&gt; actionVerbs.includes(t)),&#10;    avgWordIdf: tokens.reduce((sum, t) =&gt; sum + (vocabulary.get(t) ?? 0), 0) / tokens.length,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> QueryIntent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'navigational'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'informational'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'transactional'</span><span style=\